    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Double Detective?</h2>Double Detective is a short and casual puzzle game where players need to spot differences between two isometric dioramas.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>80 handmade levels!<br>Fully 3D where you can rotate and zoom in up close!<br>Relax with our groovy tunes!<br>Meditative gameplay with no timers, meters or scores!<br><br><strong>Change the way you look at things</strong> - Play in a 3D environment and interact with the scene by adjusting your angle and zooming in your view.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411380/extras/a7cd0f1bbef2c45c70869f63ea71c3a4.poster.avif?t=1745695406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411380/extras/a7cd0f1bbef2c45c70869f63ea71c3a4.webm?t=1745695406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411380/extras/a7cd0f1bbef2c45c70869f63ea71c3a4.mp4?t=1745695406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Relax and have fun at your own pace</strong> - There are no time limits or scores, so you don\u2019t have to worry about how long you spend in a level. Set your favorite music and enjoy!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Double Detective?</h2>Double Detective is a short and casual puzzle game where players need to spot differences between two isometric dioramas.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>80 handmade levels!<br>Fully 3D where you can rotate and zoom in up close!<br>Relax with our groovy tunes!<br>Meditative gameplay with no timers, meters or scores!<br><br><strong>Change the way you look at things</strong> - Play in a 3D environment and interact with the scene by adjusting your angle and zooming in your view.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411380/extras/a7cd0f1bbef2c45c70869f63ea71c3a4.poster.avif?t=1745695406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411380/extras/a7cd0f1bbef2c45c70869f63ea71c3a4.webm?t=1745695406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411380/extras/a7cd0f1bbef2c45c70869f63ea71c3a4.mp4?t=1745695406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Relax and have fun at your own pace</strong> - There are no time limits or scores, so you don\u2019t have to worry about how long you spend in a level. Set your favorite music and enjoy!",
